    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://mastodon.gamedev.place/@djlink/117245202971224502</guid>
      <link>https://mastodon.gamedev.place/@djlink/117245202971224502</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 05:57:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;PlayStation dropped out of Kojima new game and XBOX joined as the new publisher. Now I’m really curious about what Sony decided it wasn’t worth pursuing anymore.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://cdn.masto.host/mastodongamedevplace/media_attachments/files/117/245/202/926/493/259/original/2fdda170eea74279.jpeg" type="image/jpeg" fileSize="154369" medium="image">
        <media:rating scheme="urn:simple">nonadult</media:rating>
        <media:description type="plain">An update from PlayStation Studios: After careful consideration, we have made the difficult decision to step away from collaborating with KOJIMA PRODUCTIONS on its project PHYSINT. We continue to have great admiration for Hideo Kojima's vision for the game.
Our relationship remains strong after three decades of industry-leading, genre-defining creative cooperation, and we look forward to continued close collaboration with Hideo Kojima and his award-winning independent studio in the future.</media:description>
      </media:content>
      <media:content url="https://cdn.masto.host/mastodongamedevplace/media_attachments/files/117/245/202/913/820/298/original/6fd2fae555a2b438.jpeg" type="image/jpeg" fileSize="99537" medium="image">
        <media:rating scheme="urn:simple">nonadult</media:rating>
        <media:description type="plain">A screenshot from From @XBOX on Twitter/X post 

We started with OD. Now, our partnership with KOJIMA PRODUCTIONS is expanding to PHYSINT.
We're just getting started. xbx.Iv/4ig94j7</media:description>
      </media:content>
    </item>
